# Round XXVI Track C — `&`-of-a-place as a bare `while`-condition.
# One costume of the operand-position class; retired by the
# ONE-PRODUCER chokepoint at the `check_expr::Expr::MutableBorrow`
# arm. While-cond reaches the chokepoint via the `Stmt::While` arm
# in `check_stmt` recursing through `self.check_expr(cond)`.
#
# Pre-fix (measured at HEAD via scout probe): `gg check` clean.
# INTENDED: reject at check-time with `E_AmpInOperandPosition`.
# CO-EMITS (structural, unavoidable — `check_gg_fails` substring
# match is fine): `E_TypeMismatch` (`while` expects `bool`; the
# operand-position `&` typechecks as an int-ish value). Same-arm
# family with `sound_amp_operand_if_cond_error.gg` for `if`.

struct Counter:
    int fd

int seed():
    return 0

void main():
    Counter c = Counter(seed())
    while &c.fd:
        break
    print(c.fd)
